Terminals
 ├─ Brackets/Separators: LBRACE, RBRACE, LBRACK, RBRACK, COLON, COMMA
 ├─ Primitives: INT, DECIMAL, FLOAT, ESCAPED_STRING
 ├─ Labels: DIMENSIONS, COLORS, MATERIAL, TEXTURE, STRUCTURAL, etc.

Structured Dimensions
 ├─ aperture_dimensions
 ├─ hollow_sphere_dimensions / closed_sphere_dimensions
 ├─ hollow_cone_dimensions / closed_cone_dimensions
 ├─ hollow_torus_dimensions / closed_torus_dimensions

Design Properties
 ├─ container_aesthetic_design
 │   ├─ color_list
 │   └─ texture_setting
 └─ container_structural_design
     ├─ material_setting
     ├─ fragility_rate
     └─ density/friction/restitution

Core Shapes
 ├─ conical_full_hollow_shape / conical_full_closed_shape
 ├─ spherical_full_hollow_shape / spherical_full_closed_shape
 └─ torus_full_hollow_shape / torus_full_closed_shape

Component Parts
 ├─ body (hollow parts + base)
 ├─ aperture (profile + dimensions)
 ├─ closure (lid or stopper)
 ├─ handle / spout / feet
 └─ support

Functional Designs
 ├─ deep_container: mug, bowl, pot, bottle
 ├─ flat_container: plate, spoon
 ├─ big_storage_container: shelf, drawer
 └─ small_storage_container: box

Scene Containers
 └─ start_container: container (all above)

Furniture
 └─ start_support: chair, table (with supports & optional feet)

Top-Level
 ├─ start → scene_container | scene_support

